1
00:00:25,664 --> 00:00:28,784
Look! This is my uncle’s farm.

2
00:00:29,424 --> 00:00:33,568
It’s a big farm. The grass is so green.

3
00:00:33,984 --> 00:00:36,368
You can see many kinds of animals.

4
00:00:36,704 --> 00:00:43,424
He has pigs,horses, cows, ducks, sheep, and chickens.

5
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:45,968
How many ducks does my uncle have?

6
00:00:46,528 --> 00:00:56,048
Let me count. One, two, three, four, five,... fourteen ducks!

7
00:00:56,656 --> 00:00:58,816
Oh, no. Look there!

8
00:00:59,104 --> 00:01:01,872
Another duck is behind the big tree.

9
00:01:02,864 --> 00:01:06,976
Do you see that house? That’s my uncle’s home.

10
00:01:07,344 --> 00:01:11,120
It’s beautiful. Do you like my uncle’s farm

